        "data": {
          "headingId": "什么是索引"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "索引（Index）是存储在磁盘上的、对数据库表中一列或多列进行排序的数据结构，其核心目的是加快数据的查询与更新。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "要点："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "索引是单独存储在磁盘上的数据库结构，包含对数据表中所有记录的引用指针。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "在存储引擎层实现，因此不同存储引擎的索引实现不完全相同，也不一定支持所有索引类型。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "常见误区：索引不是放在内存里的“目录”，而是持久化在磁盘上、随表数据一起维护的结构。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
