              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "索引是磁盘上的数据结构，占用额外存储空间"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "2"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "创建与维护索引需要耗时，且随数据量增长代价越来越大"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "3"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "对表数据进行增删改时，索引需动态维护，降低数据写入/更新速度"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "索引的本质是用空间换时间、用写入代价换查询性能，因此需按实际查询模式合理设计，避免盲目建索引。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "索引底层实现：为什么是 B+Tree"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "索引底层实现为什么是-btree"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "MySQL InnoDB 引擎的索引底层采用 B+Tree。要理解为什么是 B+Tree，需要先理解 B-Tree，以及为什么不用二叉搜索树、AVL、红黑树。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "核心约束：磁盘 I/O 才是性能瓶颈。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "索引存储在磁盘上，数据量可能极大，无法一次性全部加载进内存。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "数据库按磁盘页（Page）为单位加载数据，一个磁盘页通常对应索引树的一个节点。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "一次查找经历的树深度 = 磁盘 I/O 次数。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "二叉树是“瘦高”结构，深度大 → I/O 次数多。虽然内存中的比较次数没变，但磁盘 I/O 次数才是影响查询与更新的关键。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "解决思路：把“瘦高”的二叉树变“矮胖” → 多路平衡树（B 树 / B+ 树），在比较次数不增加的前提下显著降低深度，从而减少 I/O 次数。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B 树（B-Tree）特点与查找示例"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "b-树b-tree特点与查找示例"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "注意读音：B-Tree 读作 “B 树”，不是 “B 减树”。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B 树特点"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "b-树特点"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B 树是一种 m 叉的多路平衡查找树，性质如下："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "每个节点最多含有 m 个孩子。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "根节点含有 [2, m] 个孩子。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "非叶子节点含有 [⌈m/2⌉, m] 个孩子（⌈ ⌉ 表示向上取整）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "一个节点若含有 k 个关键字，则它有 k+1 个孩子。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "所有叶子节点都在同一层（平衡性保证）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "每个节点的 k 个关键字把节点拆成 k+1 段，对应 k+1 个孩子区间。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B 树查找示例（查找元素 5）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "b-树查找示例查找元素-5"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "以一棵根节点关键字为 [8]、首个孩子为 [2 6]、下一级孩子为 [3 5] 的 B 树为例，查找元素 5 的过程："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图内容描述：B 树根节点仅含关键字 8，下方分出多个孩子区间；首次磁盘 I/O 加载根节点，内存比较确定 5 落在左子树。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图内容描述：加载根节点第一个孩子节点 [2 6]，第二次比较后确定 5 落在第二段子区间。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "flowchart TD\n    subgraph IO1[第 1 次磁盘IO · 根节点]\n        R[\"[8]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph IO2[第 2 次磁盘IO · 孩子节点]\n        N[\"[2 6]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph IO3[第 3 次磁盘IO · 叶子节点]\n        L[\"[3 5]\"]\n    end\n    R -->|5 小于 8，进入左子树| N\n    N -->|5 大于 2 小于 6，进入第二段| L\n    L -->|内存比较命中| F([找到 5])"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "说明：共经历 3 次磁盘 I/O。比较次数与二叉搜索树相比并没有减少，但 I/O 次数大幅下降——磁盘 I/O 才是影响性能的关键，因此这就足够了。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B+ 树（B+Tree）特点"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "b-树btree特点"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B+ 树是 n 路查找平衡树，在 B 树基础上做了关键改造："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图内容描述：B+ 树非叶子节点只存索引关键字、不存数据；所有数据都在叶子节点，且叶子节点之间用链表按关键字大小顺序串联。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "flowchart TD\n    subgraph NonLeaf[非叶子节点 · 仅索引]\n        NL1[\"[16]\"]\n        NL2[\"[3]\"]\n        NL3[\"[10]\"]\n        NL4[\"[20]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Leaf[叶子节点 · 存数据 + 链表串联]\n        L1[\"3 → 5 → 9\"]\n        L2[\"10 → 11 → 13\"]\n        L3[\"16 → 17\"]\n        L4[\"20 → 21 → 22\"]\n    end\n    NL1 --> NL2\n    NL1 --> NL3\n    NL3 --> NL4\n    NL2 --> L1\n    NL2 --> L2\n    NL3 --> L3\n    NL3 --> L4\n    L1 <--> L2\n    L2 <--> L3\n    L3 <--> L4"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B+ 树特点列表"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "b-树特点列表"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "含 n 个关键字的非叶子节点具有 n 个孩子（B 树是 n+1）；非叶子节点的关键字只用于索引、不保存实际数据，数据全部落在叶子节点。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "所有叶子节点包含全部关键字信息及指向记录的指针，并按关键字大小自小到大顺序链接（形成有序链表）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "非叶子节点相当于索引层，其关键字仅含子树中最大/最小的部分边界值。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "同一关键字可能在多个节点重复出现：非叶子节点是索引，叶子节点才保存真实数据。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B+ 树相比 B 树的查询优势"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "b-树相比-b-树的查询优势"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "align": [
          null,
          null,
          null
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "1"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "中间节点不存数据 → 更“矮胖”"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "磁盘页能容纳更多索引项，树高度更低，I/O 更少"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "2"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "查询必须走到叶子节点 → 更稳定"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "B 树命中即返回，深度不固定；B+ 树所有查询路径长度相同，查询效率更稳定"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "3"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "范围查询只需遍历叶子链表"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "B+ 树叶子节点有序串联；B 树需反复中序遍历，效率极低"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "数据库为何选择 B+ 树"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "数据库为何选择-b-树"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "B+ 树比 B 树更适合文件索引与数据库索引的原因："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "磁盘读写代价更低：B+ 树内部节点不保存指向数据具体信息的指针，节点更小 → 同一磁盘页能容纳更多关键字 → 单次 I/O 读入的关键字更多 → I/O 次数降低。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "查询效率更稳定：任何关键字的查找都必须从根走到叶子，路径长度一致，每个数据查询效率相当。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "范围查询友好（最主要原因）：数据库基于范围的查询（range query）非常频繁。B+ 树只需遍历叶子节点链表即可完成整棵树遍历；B 树只能中序遍历所有节点，效率太低。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "充分利用局部性原理与磁盘预读：数据库将节点大小设为等于一个页（Page），每次 I/O 即可完整载入一个节点。而红黑树等“瘦高”结构高度更深，且逻辑上相邻的父子节点物理上可能相距很远，无法利用局部性。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "方便扫库：B+ 树直接从叶子节点顺序扫描即可，B 树必须用中序遍历按序扫库。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "一句话总结：数据库系统选用 B+ 树的最主要原因——方便 range 扫描、支持高效范围查询，且通过“矮胖”结构把磁盘 I/O 降到最低。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
